## Scenarios

### Simple Function Inlining

#### extracts named callees without requiring FuncPtr metadata

- Verify: extracts named callees without requiring FuncPtr metadata
   - Expected: name != nil is true
   - Expected: name.unwrap() equals `self`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 7 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: extracts named callees without requiring FuncPtr metadata")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
val analyzer = InlineCostAnalyzer.new(50)
val callee = MirOperand(kind: MirOperandKind.Const(MirConstValue.Str("self"), MirType.unit()))
val name = analyzer.extract_operand_function_name(callee)
expect(name != nil).to_equal(true)
expect(name.unwrap()).to_equal("self")
```

</details>

